@startuml A02-state-data
!pragma layout smetana
title A02 状态与时间数据（已确认，2026-11-05）\n所有可变流程数据仅由 UExperimentSubsystem 写入
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F0FDF4
skinparam classBorderColor #16A34A
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
hide empty members
top to bottom direction

class FExperimentRunState <<USTRUCT>> {
  RunId / Phase
  ThreatObserved：由发现起点派生
  AftermathObserved / AwaitingAftermath
  SwordUsed / MagicUsed
  RescueOutcome / LockedBranch / EndReasons
  Timing : FExperimentTiming
  TransitionToken / SkipReady
  ControlRestoreRequested
  CrowdContentDelivered / TeacherRecallDelivered
}
class FExperimentTiming <<USTRUCT>> {
  WorldStartedAt / ThreatDiscoveredAt
  FirstAttackAt / RescueClosedAt
  RevisitStartedAt / AttemptEndedAt
  bEnteredTimeSkip
  + DeriveStageDurations()
}
class FOptionalExperimentMoment <<USTRUCT>> {
  bIsSet : bool
  Value : FExperimentMoment
}
class FExperimentMoment <<USTRUCT>> {
  EngineWorldSeconds : double
  RealSeconds : double
}
class FExperimentFactContext <<USTRUCT>> {
  RunId / Sequence
  OccurredAt : FExperimentMoment
}
enum EExperimentPhase {
  Preparing
  Rescue
  TimeSkip
  Revisit
  Ended
}
class "各类型化事实" as Facts <<分开的 USTRUCT>> {
  Context : FExperimentFactContext
  类型专属 ActionId / BatchId / Token 等
}

FExperimentRunState *-- "1" FExperimentTiming
FExperimentRunState --> EExperimentPhase : Phase
FExperimentTiming *-- "6" FOptionalExperimentMoment : 可选边界点
FOptionalExperimentMoment *-- "1" FExperimentMoment
FExperimentFactContext *-- "1" FExperimentMoment : 发生时采样
Facts *-- "1" FExperimentFactContext : 共用元数据

legend bottom
  bIsSet=false 表示尚未发生，不能用 0 秒代替。
  救援成功边界共用于跳时开始；恢复控制边界共用于回访开始。
  时间差从这些边界派生；补结算环境的逻辑时间不冒充事件发生时间。
endlegend
@enduml
